; The joint gizmo of a Generic6DOFJoint3D, the one variable no other golden moves: per axis a travel
; segment with a square at each end, or a short segment where the linear limit is off, and a circle
; around that axis toward each body (ADR-0056). The limits differ per axis and are not Godot's defaults,
; and both bodies sit away from the joint and not straight above or below it. No other scene shows a
; regression in a gizmo shape, since only a golden with `gizmos: true` draws one.
